WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
- All right y'all,
(audience cheers)

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.570
let's close out with just
a little more holiday joy.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.750
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.130
(upbeat music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:09.660
A Washington D.C. baker

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.700
recently got the early Christmas gift

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.110
he had been waiting for.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.420
Kareem, also known as Mr. Bake,

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.600
was just named as a James
Beard Award semi-finalist

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.970
for outstanding pastry chef or baker.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.438
So amazing.
(audience applauds)

00:00:22.438 --> 00:00:26.130
He's the first queer Black
man to actually earn the honor

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.630
and we have him on the line right now.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.340
Everybody say hello to Mr. Bake

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.635
watching on NBC4 Washington.

00:00:31.635 --> 00:00:33.372
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:33.372 --> 00:00:35.747
What's up, Mr. Bake?
- Hey Kelly!

00:00:35.747 --> 00:00:37.058
How you doing, girlfriend?

00:00:37.058 --> 00:00:37.891
- Well, congrats.

00:00:37.891 --> 00:00:39.720
You the best smile ever, oh my gosh.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.340
So, congratulations.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.470
This is a long time coming, right?

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.760
- Absolutely, Kelly.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:45.600
Listen here, girlfriend.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.660
I have been baking since
I was eight years old,

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.460
and it has been a journey.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.700
And I am super excited
to be leading the path

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.880
for open more Black men in baking.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.110
I don't know if you know, Kelly,

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:01.200
but statistics are in America now,

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.650
there is about what,
10% Black men who bake

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:07.470
and about 9% who identify with queer.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.530
So I'm super excited to be
leading this charge, girlfriend.

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.030
- Yeah!
(audience cheers)

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.400
I love, with that smile.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.193
Well, you're doing a special fundraiser

00:01:16.193 --> 00:01:18.930
for the LGBTQ+ community for the holidays,

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:20.190
so tell everybody about it.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.420
- Oh my God, yes, yes, yes.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.450
So, I'm partnering up with one
of the largest organizations

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.270
here in Washington D.C.
called Us Helping Us.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.230
And they service the youth,
adults, and homelessness,

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.990
HIV/AIDS, mental health, you name it,

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.820
they've probably got the help for you.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:39.150
We are partnering up to bring
a gingerbread competition

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:42.900
where we will give them pre-made
gingerbreads and supplies

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.510
and they have to decorate them in teams.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.330
So, it's about team
building and expression.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.538
- Yeah, I love working as a team.

00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:52.371
(audience applauds)

00:01:52.371 --> 00:01:53.204
So wait, I hear that you have

00:01:53.204 --> 00:01:55.380
a gingerbread house there, right?

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.180
- Oh, girlfriend.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.282
You already know it.

00:01:59.282 --> 00:02:01.450
- I, oh my gosh!

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:04.507
(audience cheers)

00:02:04.507 --> 00:02:06.167
Okay.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:08.310
Okay, sir.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.080
I have a few of those
in my house right now

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.009
and they do not look like that.

00:02:12.009 --> 00:02:12.842
(all laughing)

00:02:12.842 --> 00:02:15.033
Thank you so much Mr.
Bake, congratulations!

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.584
- Thank you, happy holidays!
- I'm liking your post

00:02:17.584 --> 00:02:18.433
right now.
(bell dinging)

00:02:18.433 --> 00:02:19.770
And that's not all.

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:22.290
Our season-long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of FriXion,

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:24.270
the go-to erasable pen of
"The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.340
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly,

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.360
just like you, sir.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.620
So they are gonna give Us
Helping Us $1,000 to help out.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.788
How's that sound?

00:02:32.788 --> 00:02:34.122
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:02:34.122 --> 00:02:34.955
- Thank you!

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.686
- Oh my God, I love you so much.

00:02:38.686 --> 00:02:41.657
You've gotta come visit us in person!

00:02:41.657 --> 00:02:43.417
Thank you so much for joining us

00:02:43.417 --> 00:02:45.241
and thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:02:45.241 --> 00:02:49.005
Barry Manilow, Teddy Swims,
Lauren, Zarian, and Josiah.

00:02:49.005 --> 00:02:52.164
Y'all have a great day, and if
it's not, try and change it.

